Understood [~accountid:63985ce2f7f0ee492fcea284] - thanks. 

My remarks & suggestions:

{quote}_If one of the Parties, in the course of the performance of its obligations under this Agreement, gains access to personal data of employees of the other Party or persons connected with the other Party in civil-legal relations (respectively, “Personal Data”, “Employees” and “Receiving Party”), then such Party (“Transmitting Party”) grants the Receiving Party the right to process Personal Data_{color:#bf2600} _for the purposes of the Agreement_{color} -_in accordance with the internal policy of the Transmitting Party_-_._ {color:#ff5630}_For the avoidance of doubt, where the receiving Party collects personal data independently from the Employees, it will process this personal data independently as a separate data controller._{color}{quote}

I suggest to remove the reference to the internal policies of the Transmitting Party as Bolt cannot undertake to process personal data per customer’s internal policies.

{quote}_In this case, the Receiving Party undertakes to process Personal data in good faith, in accordance with the requirements of the applicable legislation of the Republic of Azerbaijan and for purposes consistent with the fulfillment of obligations under this Agreement, to ensure the appropriate protection and confidentiality of Personal data_-_, and to destroy Personal data within 10 (ten) calendar days from the date of termination of this Agreement_-_._ {color:#bf2600}_The Receiving Party will collaborate in good faith with the Transmitting Party on the deletion of personal data of the Employees as soon as reasonably possible._{color}{color:#bf2600} {color}{color:#bf2600} _Transmitting Party_{color}{color:#bf2600} acknowledges that t{color}{color:#bf2600}_he Receiving Party provides to the Transmitting Party automated functionality to delete personal data its Employees provided in the Business Portal._{color}{quote}

Please coordinate with the customer to confirm the updated wording, and if all is agreed, please add to the agreement. I will close the privacy ticket, but can re-open if the customer gets back to us with new privacy related inquiries.

